title: 'network-transactions: prevent duplicate import reputation'
doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
    description: |
      Record each peer only once per pending transaction import, preventing
      repeated submissions from multiplying verification charges or import
      reputation rewards. Distinct peers still receive their own import result,
      and transactions can be retried after an inconclusive import.
      No API changes, protocol changes, or storage migration are required.
crates:
  - name: sc-network-transactions
    bump: patch
